Hello All,

The flow-way inside diameter for the branch of a Nupi Electrofusion x Swive=
l Saddle is 1.81=94

The maximum standard hole saw that can be used is 1 =BE=94.  Care must be t=
aken in that there is a fairly tight diametral clearance of .06=94.  The st=
ainless steel internal sleeve in the saddle will protect the saddle  should=
 the installers aim be poor.

John

